From 1aa2c910709fb4a03f2fdf7bd34014b084ec2263 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: blame42 <346530647+git-blame-42@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 17:29:55 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Warn when saving an event without changes

Event::hasChanges() loads the stored event once and compares every column
with normalized values (int vs string capacity, SET order, CRLF line
breaks). The update action shows a warning flash and skips the save.
---
 app/Controllers/Admin/EventsController.php    |  6 ++
 app/Models/Event.php                          | 44 +++++++++++
 lib/FlashMessage.php                          |  5 ++
 .../admin/events/UpdateSuccessfullyCest.php   | 34 +++++++++
 .../Admin/EventsControllerTest.php            | 29 ++++++++
 tests/Unit/Lib/FlashMessageTest.php           |  9 +++
 tests/Unit/Models/Events/EventTest.php        | 74 +++++++++++++++++++
 7 files changed, 201 insertions(+)

